#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:5 4ccf266778cb452484b1c4a885495548
msgid "SWAN-K1 HWing"
msgstr "SWAN-K1 HWing"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:7 79d76b8234e6464caea42c6218438e1c
msgid ""
"This autopilot is a part of a :ref:`ready-to-fly vehicle <common-rtf>` in  "
"the form of a control-surfaceless, quad-copter Tailsitter QuadPlane. It "
"comes with customized PX4 firmware installed and an GCS application that is "
"downloadable for smart phones. This page describes the conversion to "
"ArduPilot firmware and its setup."
msgstr ""
"该飞控是一款 :ref:`即飞型飞行器 <common-rtf>` 的组成部分，形态为无控制面、四轴尾座式 QuadPlane。出厂预装定制版 PX4 "
"固件及可下载至智能手机的 GCS 应用程序。本页介绍如何将其转换为 ArduPilot 固件并进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:9 103db90b135b4ff88ed6798618074276
msgid ""
"It was initially offered with a 10 channel RC transmitter using an external "
"smart phone for GCS and video display, and the Pro version comes with a 12 "
"channel system with an integrated screen for the GCS/Video."
msgstr "该产品最初配备 10 通道遥控器，使用外接手机作为 GCS 和视频显示；Pro 版本配备 12 通道系统，内置 GCS/视频显示屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:14 b9246a7050594aeda5f7753d1d02191d
msgid "ArduPilot Firmware Installation"
msgstr "ArduPilot 固件安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:16 afdae3435d66401b83e18cc33a8694f0
msgid ""
"You will need to remove the access cover in order to attach a USB cable to "
"the autopilot. Installing a short 90 deg USB pigtail, routed into the "
"battery compartment will allow easy USB connections in the future."
msgstr "您需要拆下检修盖，才能将 USB 线连接至飞控。建议安装一根短 90° USB 转接线并引至电池舱，以便日后方便连接 USB。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:21 eb48838b2daa417ebfd8ae680426af0d
msgid ""
"Connect to Mission Planner or QGC, and upload the Plane firmware for the "
"SWAN-K1 located `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"连接至 Mission Planner 或 QGC，并上传 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的 "
"SWAN-K1 Plane 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:23 9e200edcd40f429a9c68e1c1e3d39107
msgid ""
"The firmware has defaults already set for optimum tuning and operation."
msgstr "固件已预设了最佳调参和操作默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:26 74dd9c56528041889517d03e0c901992
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:28 ab878daa4124443bb94929d729af527a
msgid ""
"Once the new ArduPilot firmware is loaded, you will only need to "
":ref:`calibrate the accelerometers <common-accelerometer-calibration>` and "
":ref:`calibrate the compass<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`."
" The level point for the accelerometer calibration should be normal fixed "
"wing flight attitude."
msgstr ""
"加载新 ArduPilot 固件后，只需 :ref:`校准加速度计 <common-accelerometer-calibration>` 和 "
":ref:`校准罗盘<common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>` "
"即可。加速度计校准的水平基准应以正常固定翼飞行姿态为准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:31 69035f5ef1b6406eacf389ace12028bf
msgid "System Setup"
msgstr "系统设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:33 cbb7022fb1a94330b640de6b9078e3a6
msgid "The defaults provide for basic operation:"
msgstr "默认值已提供基本操作支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:35 6d6317c7e59e4b11b7285a75cf9b8888
msgid ""
"Flight modes are on the upper left three position switch: "
"QHOVER/QLOITER/FBWA"
msgstr "飞行模式由左上方三位开关控制：QHOVER/QLOITER/FBWA"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:36 16205c0f70094c6aac4b16aefe53863f
msgid ""
"QRTL is on button \"B\". Note this, and other buttons, are locking toggle "
"switches!"
msgstr "QRTL 在 「B」 按钮上。注意该按钮和其他按钮均为锁定拨动开关！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:37 6fd8dda4c56a4be088551e648f4b2125
msgid "Mode 2 AETR stick setup."
msgstr "Mode 2 AETR 摇杆设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:38 1971e3b63b1f4c5a92af4f2b88fc768d
msgid "Arming/Disarming is done via rudder at lowest throttle."
msgstr "解锁/上锁通过最低油门时打方向舵完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:40 aef67f6e8a504289b2e723b24b915f6d
msgid ""
"once armed, and the center sprung throttle is allowed to return to center, "
"the vehicle may start to  lift off slowly. Also, be sure to arm only in "
"QHOVER or QLOITER!"
msgstr "解锁后，弹性复位油门杆回中后飞行器可能开始缓慢升空。解锁请仅在 QHOVER 或 QLOITER 模式下进行！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:42 f6874c85fe064827a63b162f171a7408
msgid ""
"Failsafe is setup by default to execute the :ref:`Hybrid RTL/QRTL "
"<quadplane_rtl>` function with :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` = 3."
msgstr ""
"失控保护默认执行 :ref:`混合 RTL/QRTL <quadplane_rtl>` 功能，:ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>`"
" = 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:45 78e38986aa7d4fd3b66dc765dfc0cf62
msgid "Customization"
msgstr "自定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:47 2f1026c2e9f54680bb8e0d642d65df69
msgid ""
"One of the benefits of using ArduPilot is that you can set transmitter "
"functions easily."
msgstr "使用 ArduPilot 的好处之一是可以方便地设置遥控器功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:49 12cecc4fc55c424d947ded612849ffb6
msgid ""
"Some possibilities using :ref:`RC Auxiliary Functions<common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`:"
msgstr "使用 :ref:`RC 辅助功能<common-auxiliary-functions>` 的一些可能设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:51 04d13f9be5c34865bfc3b8231e16c521
msgid ""
"Set one of the switches as ARM/DISARM for quick disarming instead of the "
"rudder/throttle combination."
msgstr "将某个开关设为 ARM/DISARM，以快速上锁，而非使用方向舵/油门组合。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:52 289c2f1a30ec48dba8c11f3e1f83f40f
msgid ""
"Set other flight modes, such as CRUISE or QLAND, on one of the other "
"switches or buttons"
msgstr "在其他开关或按钮上设置其他飞行模式，例如 CRUISE 或 QLAND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:53 a6cb3bd6632448cdaeed4bdb1a03100b
msgid "Set AUTO mode, on a button"
msgstr "在某个按钮上设置 Auto 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:54 99aebcde5d544df1b8341566a24bfcd5
msgid ""
"Set up :ref:`fences<common-geofencing-landing-page>` and enable/disable via "
"switch or button."
msgstr "设置 :ref:`电子围栏<common-geofencing-landing-page>` 并通过开关或按钮启用/禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:57 44d771512b5343aea2b13912fa3426f9
