#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:78 4f136d55d8f446d7a5216c34cc203a22
msgid ""
"With the T10 transmitter, MAVLink is available for connection via BlueTooth "
"connection from the transmitter. You can connect and run any GCS (Mission "
"Planner, QGC, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"使用 T10 遥控器时，可通过遥控器的蓝牙连接使用 MAVLink。可连接并运行任何 GCS（Mission Planner、QGC 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:80 42a3a1b58aea42d99502e57483cca46f
msgid ""
"With the H12 transmitter, you may load and use Mission Planner. The Android "
"compatible Mission Planner applet (.apk) is located `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/releases/tag/latest>`__. But "
"first you must download and run this `HEQ .apk  application "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/misc/Heq_H12_20210526.apk>`__ before "
"starting Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"使用 H12 遥控器时，可加载并使用 Mission Planner。Android 兼容的 Mission Planner 应用（.apk）位于 "
"`此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/releases/tag/latest>`__。但在启动 "
"Mission Planner 之前，必须先下载并运行 `HEQ .apk 应用 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/misc/Heq_H12_20210526.apk>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:83 b7de31dd7fdc4759a9d9f2ef21ccb12a
msgid "Video Display"
msgstr "视频显示"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:85 2b877cbedc3d40ccad5199eaa87a26d2
msgid ""
"With the T10 transmitter you must connect a smart phone via the transmitters"
" USB connector and use the `HEQ Fly app <https://www.pgyer.com/xpLb>`__ to "
"display the video. You can connect the app via Bluetooth for limited GCS "
"display in the same app, but usually connecting to another phone or PC for a"
" GCS will allow the full GCS capabilities using MAVlink to be exploited."
msgstr ""
"使用 T10 遥控器时，需通过遥控器的 USB 接口连接智能手机，并使用 `HEQ Fly 应用 "
"<https://www.pgyer.com/xpLb>`__ 显示视频。可通过蓝牙连接该应用以获得有限的 GCS 显示功能，但通常连接至其他手机或 "
"PC 作为 GCS 才能充分利用 MAVLink 的全部 GCS 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:87 66f3d1ef7598427e816839a812bc0c10
msgid "The H12 transmitter has video display built in."
msgstr "H12 遥控器内置视频显示功能。"

